{
  "id": 8834121498823,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Court Perspective Comforter with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-court-perspective-comforter-with-name-and-number-5545af9fa4-5545af9fa4",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring the excitement of the game right into your bedroom with the sports bedding comforter by Jeminise. This custom comforter is designed for basketball lovers of all ages, offering a cozy and stylish way to show off your passion for the sport. Whether you are decorating a kids' room or updating your own bedding, this personalized comforter adds a unique, energetic touch to any sleeping space.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Make it uniquely yours with custom name and number text inputs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling that prevents clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sporty Style:</strong> Features a vibrant basketball graphic illustration design, perfect for sports enthusiasts.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water for simple maintenance and quick air drying.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Set comes with a comfortable duvet cover zipper closure.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Art, Number, Personalized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
